WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.200
-Welcome, welcome, welcome,
welcome, welcome, welcome

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.434
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:05.534
You're here. You made it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:08.767
Thank you for watching at home.

00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:09.801
Let's get to some news.

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:11.033
Well, guys, today,
President Biden

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.667
visited a farm in Illinois,
where he announced

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:17.033
new steps to fight rising
food costs and inflation.

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:19.334
You know your presidency
is in rough shape

00:00:19.334 --> 00:00:20.534
when your staff is like,

00:00:20.534 --> 00:00:22.968
"It's time to drive you
to a farm upstate."

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.033
Yeah, the entire time, Biden was
walking around the farm going,

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:30.100
"Seriously, if I don't have
enough crap to deal with.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.868
Actually, I have more crap
I have to deal with."

00:00:32.868 --> 00:00:34.734
Yeah, when Biden first arrived,

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.334
a Secret Service agent was like,

00:00:36.334 --> 00:00:39.601
"Older McDonald is on the farm.

00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:42.868
E-I-E-I-O."

00:00:45.033 --> 00:00:46.367
But this was strange.

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:47.868
At one point, Biden actually
walked into a cornfield

00:00:47.868 --> 00:00:50.467
and slowly disappeared.

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:54.133
"If you build back better,
votes will come."

00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:55.534
Well, everyone's
talking about this.

00:00:55.534 --> 00:00:59.133
Yesterday, the pilot on a flight
from the Bahamas to Florida

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:02.267
had a medical emergency,
and a passenger with no idea

00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:06.267
how to fly successfully landed
the plane at the airport.

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:09.200
[ Cheers and applause ]
It's amazing.

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.601
-Wow!

00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:14.267
-You could tell the guy
didn't know how to fly

00:01:14.267 --> 00:01:16.601
'cause the plane
actually arrived on time.

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:20.767
And as if this story
wasn't crazy enough,

00:01:20.767 --> 00:01:22.801
listen to the name of
the air traffic controller

00:01:22.801 --> 00:01:25.467
who talked the passenger
through the whole thing.

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:27.801
-With us now,
the air traffic controller

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:30.501
who helped that passenger
land the plane safely.

00:01:30.501 --> 00:01:33.300
Captain Morgan, it is amazing
to have you here.

00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:37.200
-"You're going to help me --

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:38.968
you're going to help me
land this thing?

00:01:38.968 --> 00:01:40.367
Who is this?"
"It's Captain Morgan."

00:01:40.367 --> 00:01:43.534
"Oh, my gosh! Call my wife!"

00:01:45.501 --> 00:01:47.834
Captain Morgan.

00:01:47.834 --> 00:01:48.968
Then, when they
got on the runway,

00:01:48.968 --> 00:01:50.968
the ground crew
was led by Jack Daniels.

00:01:50.968 --> 00:01:53.934
"Thank you, Jack Daniels."

00:01:54.734 --> 00:01:55.934
Some entertainment news.

00:01:55.934 --> 00:01:57.701
A bill was
just introduced in Congress

00:01:57.701 --> 00:02:00.934
to make ads on
streaming services quieter.

00:02:00.934 --> 00:02:02.868
[ Cheers and applause ]
You like that?

00:02:02.868 --> 00:02:04.701
[ Laughs ]

00:02:04.701 --> 00:02:06.267
Judging by this commercial
I saw today,

00:02:06.267 --> 00:02:07.367
I think it's already working.

00:02:07.367 --> 00:02:08.367
Take a look at this one.

00:02:08.367 --> 00:02:09.801
[ Birds chirping softly ]

00:02:17.067 --> 00:02:19.400
-[ Whispering ] Four Loko --
blackout in can.

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:20.734
-Yeah, it's interesting.

00:02:20.734 --> 00:02:24.100
"Blackout in a can."
Yeah, I didn't know that. Yeah.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:25.534
-Quiet.
-Yeah.

00:02:25.534 --> 00:02:27.300
Well, guys,
yesterday in New York City,

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:29.467
protestors gathered
around a Starbucks

00:02:29.467 --> 00:02:34.000
to demand that the company stop
charging extra for vegan milk.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.367
Yeah. And I thought
some of the signs

00:02:35.367 --> 00:02:36.734
at the protests
were pretty good.

00:02:36.734 --> 00:02:38.000
Yeah, this one here said...

00:02:41.033 --> 00:02:42.467
You go...

00:02:43.701 --> 00:02:45.267
And then I saw this one.

00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:50.167
-Oh.
-A good sign.

00:02:50.167 --> 00:02:51.434
-Wow!

00:02:51.434 --> 00:02:52.834
-Well, guys,
this is going viral.

00:02:52.834 --> 00:02:55.601
In Washington, state troopers
pulled over a U-Haul truck

00:02:55.601 --> 00:02:58.067
because it had an S.U.V.
Hanging out of the back of it.

00:02:58.067 --> 00:02:59.868
Take a look at this thing.

00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:07.534
I like that, like, the
one bungee cord over the back,

00:03:07.534 --> 00:03:10.501
like that's --
Can we take a look at that?

00:03:10.501 --> 00:03:14.801
Yeah. I think that's known as
a highway turducken.

00:03:16.067 --> 00:03:17.734
That's how expensive gas
is right now.

00:03:17.734 --> 00:03:20.601
Even cars are carpooling.
You know what I'm saying?

00:03:22.634 --> 00:03:23.701
Well, guys, listen to this.

00:03:23.701 --> 00:03:25.300
I heard South Korea's
new president

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:28.234
wants to change the way
age is counted there,

00:03:28.234 --> 00:03:29.601
which means, overnight,

00:03:29.601 --> 00:03:32.367
52 million South Koreans could
officially become

00:03:32.367 --> 00:03:33.968
one or two years younger.

00:03:33.968 --> 00:03:36.167
-Whoa! That's wild.

00:03:36.167 --> 00:03:37.534
-Yeah, I mean,
imagine just getting

00:03:37.534 --> 00:03:39.434
years younger just like that?

00:03:39.434 --> 00:03:42.100
-Yeah, that'd be crazy.

00:03:43.734 --> 00:03:46.634
-Yeah, too bad
it's not possible.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.534
Moving on.
Finally, did you guys see this?

00:03:50.534 --> 00:03:52.300
An oceanfront house
in North Carolina

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:55.801
